    "abilities": {
      "P": {
        "slot": "P",
        "id": "BrandPassive",
        "name": "Blaze",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Brand's spells light his targets ablaze, dealing damage over 4 seconds, stacking up to 3 times. If Brand kills an enemy while it is ablaze he regains mana. When Blaze reaches max stacks on a Champion or large monster, it becomes unstable. It detonates in 2 seconds, applying spell effects and dealing massive damage in an area around the victim.",
        "bodyHtml": "Brand's Abilities light his targets <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Ablaze</span>, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">2% max Health magic damage</span> over 4 seconds. If Brand kills a unit that is <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Ablaze</span>, he regains <span>39.983 mana</span>. <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Blaze</span> can stack up to 3 times.<br /><br />When a champion or large jungle monster reaches 3 stacks, the <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Blaze</span> will detonate after 2 seconds, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">((6% ~ 12%) + ([[si:scaleap]]2% per 100 Ability Power)) max Health magic damage</span> to surrounding enemies.",
